' =============================================
' Component Specifications
' =============================================

note as tech_specs
    <b>Technical Specifications:</b>
    
    <u>Compute:</u>
    • EKS: m5.large nodes (min: 3, max: 20)
    • Auto-scaling: CPU > 70%, Memory > 80%
    
    <u>Database:</u>
    • RDS Aurora: db.r5.2xlarge
    • Storage: 500GB GP3, 3000 IOPS
    • Backup: 35 days retention
    
    <u>Cache:</u>
    • ElastiCache: cache.r5.large
    • Cluster mode enabled
    • 30GB memory per node
    
    <u>Storage:</u>
    • S3: Standard + Intelligent Tiering
    • EFS: 100GB General Purpose
    • Lifecycle policies enabled
    
    <u>Networking:</u>
    • VPC: 10.0.0.0/16
    • Subnets: /24 CIDR blocks
    • NAT Gateway for egress
    
    <u>Security:</u>
    • IAM roles for services
    • Security groups per tier
    • WAF rules for OWASP top 10
    • TLS 1.2 minimum
end note

@enduml